Subject: [PATCH] Use S26 directional motion fallback at 60fps

Keep the resource-provided transition table as the primary source. Replace
the S24/S25 fallback selected by the device shipping API with S26 timings,
matching the converted pack. Preserve HOME_LEFT/UP/RIGHT and TOUCH variants.

--- a/smali/com/samsung/android/wallpaper/live/infinity/c.smali
